  "description": "Winnovative Next PDF Processor for .NET (macOS ARM64) is a collection of components that can be used to extract text and images from PDF documents, convert PDF documents to Markdown, search text in PDF documents and convert PDF pages to images.\n\nThe package includes the PDF to Text, PDF to Markdown, PDF to Image and PDF Images Extractor components.\n\nThe library targets .NET Standard 2.0 and can be used in .NET Core and .NET Framework applications deployed on Windows, Linux and macOS, including Azure, AWS, Google Cloud, Docker and Kubernetes.\n\nThis package installs only the macOS ARM64 runtime.\n\nSeparate packages are available for Windows, Linux or multi-platform runtimes.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* macOS Ventura or later (Apple Silicon / ARM64)\n* .NET 11.0, 10.0, 9.0, 8.0, 7.0, 6.0 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications\n\nMain Features:\n\n* Convert PDF documents to text, preserving the original layout or optimized for reading\n* Search text in PDF documents and return the exact positions of the matches\n* Convert PDF documents to Markdown with headings, lists, tables, links and images\n* Convert PDF pages to PNG images using a specified color space\n* Extract images from PDF documents in PNG format while preserving transparency\n* Process password-protected PDF documents\n* Process all PDF pages or a specified range of pages\n* Asynchronous methods for async and await\n\nDocumentation and code samples:\nhttps://www.winnovative-software.com/winnovative-pdf-next-pdf-processor-dotnet",
